**Description**

PR #7894 breaks vSonic based setup for T2 profile. The change expects all vSonic VMs to have Port Channels. In case of https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-mgmt/blob/master/ansible/vars/topo_t2_2lc_min_ports-masic.yml - Even numbered vSonic VM have PC so they work fine while odd numbered VM have issues

It also is missing leaf_asn_start in t2 yaml files.

